body:
The app is great at first glance, and still seamlessly wonderful. There is an issue with the ScrollView at Mindset page, i wish you can resolve the cutting edges of ScrollView, please don’t add the padding for ScrollView instead add it to HStack where the ForEach is embedded in;

ScrollView(.horizontal){
HStack{
ForEach(){}
}.padding(.horizontal)
}

So that user can enjoy the app in full area. 

Best regards,
Abdelkarim
iOS Developer
